#!args --verify-dirty --start-page --academy-dir apps/JFNetworker/academy
# quizzes and tests of the Akademie (workspace/academy/quiz.rs) with the sample course: practice with its
# explanations (wrong, retry, partly right, a text, a number, an order; the best result in the outline; done as
# soon as it passes); a test that waits for the quiz; its start with what it asks; an attempt with the time,
# the question before handing in, the result with the points per question and pass or not; a new attempt; the
# time running out on another page; no attempts left; English; the keyboard; a reset gives the attempts back.
# A run without a window takes a fixed order.  Ids: 136192 + k the steps of the outline (quiz 136195, fault hunt
# 136196, test 136197), 145409 Test beginnen, 145410 Abgeben, 145412 Alle Fragen von vorn, 145413 the bar of the
# points, 145664 + q * 28 the question at place q of the file: + 0 its stem, + 1 its input, + 2 Prüfen, + 3 its
# explanation, + 4 + a its answer a, + 4 + 2 * r and + 5 + 2 * r up and down of row r; 135170 back, 135202 Weiter.
size 1280 800
theme light
cmd 1005
key enter
expect text:"0 von 6 Schritten erledigt" exists
expect button:"Quiz: Netze und Adressen" exists
expect button:"Fehlersuche: der Server antwortet nicht" exists
expect button:"Test: das erste Netz, gesperrt" exists
expect #136197 disabled
expect text:"Noch gesperrt" exists
# a click on the locked test stays here
click #136197
expect text:"0 von 6 Schritten erledigt" exists
# ---- practice: nothing in a document, the widgets of the library
click #136195
expect text:"Quiz: Netze und Adressen" exists
expect text:"Schritt 4 von 6" exists
expect text:"Üben: Prüfen Sie jede Frage, so oft Sie wollen. Die Erklärung kommt gleich dazu." exists
expect text:"0 von 6 Punkten · 0 %, bestanden ab 70 %" exists
expect #145664 focused
expect text:"Frage 1 von 5" exists
expect text:"2 Punkte" exists
expect text:"Was tut ein Switch, wenn ein Rahmen ankommt?" exists
expect radio:"Er schickt ihn an den Port, hinter dem die Ziel-MAC-Adresse hängt." exists
expect #145666 disabled
expect button:"Test beginnen" missing
